{"name": "GHOST EATER", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hack n Slash action adventure game with manga inspired graphics. Explore a dense, interconnected, sci-fi, world rendered in a distinct graphical style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">what we have:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 distinct enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a unique combination of scripted and randomized arena battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 bosses\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a variety of player Skills and passives to experiment with.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching narrative integrally connected to the core combat gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 main weapon class with a 5 hit combo,\u00a0 different , slot-able, combo enders, other special contextual moves.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 secondary weapon classes, each with a 3 hit combo and a unique weapon skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cool stylish graphics ;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">what we don't have:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">dial a combo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lots of cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">voice over</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"398\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708620/extras/a5ded0b79b1e07331d832d19b46b8121.poster.avif?t=1789399548\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708620/extras/a5ded0b79b1e07331d832d19b46b8121.webm?t=1789399548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fa